  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"CwGXJ\" id=\"CwGXJ\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf665a62a\" id=\"uf665a62a\">递归简介</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u22a2f35e\" id=\"u22a2f35e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8ce06082\" id=\"u8ce06082\">递归指的是把一个大型复杂的问题层层转化为一个与原问题相似的规模较小的问题来求解</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8385bf90\" id=\"u8385bf90\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud62d6eb0\" id=\"ud62d6eb0\">如果 一个函数在</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u30d61b66\" id=\"u30d61b66\">内部调用其本身</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue25ad442\" id=\"ue25ad442\">，这个函数就是 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u818038c3\" id=\"u818038c3\">递归函数</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc85dc276\" id=\"uc85dc276\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua1bf29e6\" id=\"ua1bf29e6\">递归的好处是：只需少量的程序就可描述出解题过程所需要的多次重复计算</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc06da56c\" id=\"uc06da56c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua405c566\" id=\"ua405c566\">我们先来看看生活中递归的场景:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E4%BB%8E%E5%89%8D%E6%9C%89%E5%BA%A7%E5%B1%B1%EF%BC%8C%E5%B1%B1%E9%87%8C%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%AA%E5%BA%99%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%99%E9%87%8C%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%AA%E8%80%81%E5%92%8C%E5%B0%9A%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%99%E5%B0%8F%E5%92%8C%E5%B0%9A%E8%AE%B2%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E3%80%82%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E8%AE%B2%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9A%5Cn%E4%BB%8E%E5%89%8D%E6%9C%89%E5%BA%A7%E5%B1%B1%EF%BC%8C%E5%B1%B1%E9%87%8C%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%AA%E5%BA%99%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%99%E9%87%8C%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%AA%E8%80%81%E5%92%8C%E5%B0%9A%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%99%E5%B0%8F%E5%92%8C%E5%B0%9A%E8%AE%B2%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E3%80%82%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E8%AE%B2%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9A%5Cn%E4%BB%8E%E5%89%8D%E6%9C%89%E5%BA%A7%E5%B1%B1%EF%BC%8C%E5%B1%B1%E9%87%8C%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%AA%E5%BA%99%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%99%E9%87%8C%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%AA%E8%80%81%E5%92%8C%E5%B0%9A%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%99%E5%B0%8F%E5%92%8C%E5%B0%9A%E8%AE%B2%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E3%80%82%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E8%AE%B2%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9A%5Cn%E4%BB%8E%E5%89%8D%E6%9C%89%E5%BA%A7%E5%B1%B1%EF%BC%8C%E5%B1%B1%E9%87%8C%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%AA%E5%BA%99%EF%BC%8C%E5%BA%99%E9%87%8C%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%AA%E8%80%81%E5%92%8C%E5%B0%9A%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%99%E5%B0%8F%E5%92%8C%E5%B0%9A%E8%AE%B2%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E2%80%A6%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22o2kfK%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"QCexF\" id=\"QCexF\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9f9019da\" id=\"u9f9019da\">递归求阶乘</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u3a635ecc\" id=\"u3a635ecc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u13c9320c\" id=\"u13c9320c\">递归最经典的案例是求n的阶乘</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"udefbd21a\" id=\"udefbd21a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9bb4bd82\" id=\"u9bb4bd82\">5的阶乘：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u1bc1fa52\" id=\"u1bc1fa52\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue2ad95db\" id=\"ue2ad95db\">5*4*3*2*1</span></code></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20func(n)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20'''%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E6%B1%82n%E7%9A%84%E9%98%B6%E4%B9%98%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20n%3A%20%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E7%9A%84%E9%98%B6%E4%B9%98%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20n%E7%9A%84%E9%98%B6%E4%B9%98%5Cn%20%20%20%20'''%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20n%3D%3D1%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%201%5Cn%20%20%20%20else%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20n*func(n-1)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DfA9z%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uf83fe9ae\" id=\"uf83fe9ae\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5f8e295f\" id=\"u5f8e295f\">分析:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud1eefc17\" id=\"ud1eefc17\"><span data-lake-id=\"u708d17ed\" id=\"u708d17ed\">如果传递的是1，则1的阶乘为1</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"udbd3489a\" id=\"udbd3489a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1260e600\" id=\"u1260e600\">如果传递的是大于1的数，n的阶乘就等于n乘以n-1的阶乘</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3283e21b\" id=\"u3283e21b\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf7a1f8f5\" id=\"uf7a1f8f5\">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"okwzc\" id=\"okwzc\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua3ce2ec5\" id=\"ua3ce2ec5\">练习：</span></h2><ul list=\"ud5e2a296\"><li fid=\"ube0d4c07\" data-lake-id=\"u50745c64\" id=\"u50745c64\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubba22c0b\" id=\"ubba22c0b\">搜索资料，通过递归实现斐波那契数列</span></li></ul>",
